{"uid":"b8925373a4d6dd87","name":"test_a_hand_computed_bill_matches_the_refreshed_gpt_5_6_sol_rate","fullName":"tests.test_pricing_aws#test_a_hand_computed_bill_matches_the_refreshed_gpt_5_6_sol_rate","historyId":"fb6fe0616c7170ccdea91d7433838e72","time":{"start":1791968867202,"stop":1791968867203,"duration":1},"description":"Task 020's pi-ai 0.85.1 refresh moved `openai.gpt-5.6-sol`'s input rate\n    from 5.5 to 4.4 USD/Mtok (output 22.0, cacheRead 0.44, cacheWrite 5.5, all\n    read off the shipped table itself below -- this pins the refreshed number,\n    not the pre-refresh one).\n\n    Hand computation for 1,000,000 input + 500,000 output + 200,000 cacheRead\n    + 100,000 cacheWrite tokens, at $/Mtok input=4.4 output=22.0 cacheRead=0.44\n    cacheWrite=5.5:\n\n        input:      1,000,000 * 4.4  / 1_000_000 = 4.4\n        output:       500,000 * 22.0 / 1_000_000 = 11.0\n        cacheRead:    200,000 * 0.44 / 1_000_000 = 0.088\n        cacheWrite:   100,000 * 5.5  / 1_000_000 = 0.55\n        total = 4.4 + 11.0 + 0.088 + 0.55 = 16.038\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>Task 020's pi-ai 0.85.1 refresh moved <code>openai.gpt-5.6-sol</code>'s input rate<br />\nfrom 5.5 to 4.4 USD/Mtok (output 22.0, cacheRead 0.44, cacheWrite 5.5, all<br />\nread off the shipped table itself below -- this pins the refreshed number,<br />\nnot the pre-refresh one).</p>\n<pre><code>Hand computation for 1,000,000 input + 500,000 output + 200,000 cacheRead\n+ 100,000 cacheWrite tokens, at $/Mtok input=4.4 output=22.0 cacheRead=0.44\ncacheWrite=5.5:\n\n    input:      1,000,000 * 4.4  / 1_000_000 = 4.4\n    output:       500,000 * 22.0 / 1_000_000 = 11.0\n    cacheRead:    200,000 * 0.44 / 1_000_000 = 0.088\n    cacheWrite:   100,000 * 5.5  / 1_000_000 = 0.55\n    total = 4.4 + 11.0 + 0.088 + 0.55 = 16.038\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_poli